      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for the suggestions. One thing I'm struggling with is the nature of these entries. They are very small—hardly noticeable on a single line item—but they seem to \"pop up\" out of nowhere in various departments at odd intervals. It's almost like they are just small, random nibbles on the budget. How should I narrow down if these are just administrative errors or if there's something more intentional happening in the background?",
